# Cloudflare Pages response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/)
# This file is read by Cloudflare only; it is not a web page.
# DRAFT: the X-Robots-Tag line keeps the demo out of Google. Delete it when the site goes live.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
